Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Define MapKeyPath's gyb helpers in its template

The template imported suffix_variadic and list_with_suffix_variadic from
gyb_opencombine_support, a Python module beside gyb.py. The templates are
expanded with a gyb that has no such module, so the two functions are
defined in the template itself, with the same bodies. The expansion is
byte for byte the generated source this tree ships.
---
 .../Publishers/Publishers.MapKeyPath.swift.gyb           | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Sources/OpenCombine/Publishers/Publishers.MapKeyPath.swift.gyb b/Sources/OpenCombine/Publishers/Publishers.MapKeyPath.swift.gyb
index d195dc8..a1321b1 100644
--- a/Sources/OpenCombine/Publishers/Publishers.MapKeyPath.swift.gyb
+++ b/Sources/OpenCombine/Publishers/Publishers.MapKeyPath.swift.gyb
@@ -9,10 +9,11 @@ ${template_header}
 // swiftlint:disable large_tuple
 
 %{
-from gyb_opencombine_support import (
-    suffix_variadic,
-    list_with_suffix_variadic
-)
+def suffix_variadic(name, index, arity):
+    return name + ('' if arity == 1 else str(index))
+
+def list_with_suffix_variadic(name, arity):
+    return [suffix_variadic(name, i, arity) for i in range(arity)]
 
 import random
 
